  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: 'Console: Brick Bash'
  <Description>k__BackingField: Steer the paddle, keep the ball up and smash every
    brick. Each new wall is faster.
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 97166ec58b775864490a47cddd91414d, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Hit the ball with the paddle's edge to angle it
  - A cleared wall comes back faster
  - Crash and you restart - only your best run counts
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Smash the most bricks.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Letting the ball past your paddle ends the run.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Bricks in your best run; everyone gets the same walls.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - A / D|Move paddle
  - SPACE|Launch
